        "Description": "(First play ambrose island, then this one)\r47, Agent Smith gave me some interesting information. It is unclear why, but the Silver Senate owns some sort of superhospital in Hokkaido. The task is very simple, 47. You will have to eliminate the director of the facility. Disguise as him and look for documents in his office (there are none but for RP). Leave with the helicopter. They&apos;ll take you back home. The main goal is to find out what this hospital is about.\rGood luck, 47.",
